WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.120
Part four: Creating Legends. It's Levy's short online orientation, and every volunteer needs the certificate on file.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:16.221
Step one. Until the certificate is in, Creating Legends shows as missing on your volunteer page.

00:00:16.421 --> 00:00:18.670
Tap Upload paperwork.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:30.742
Step two. Open the Creating Legends certificate card, and tap Take the Creating Legends training. When you finish, the certificate usually arrives by email within five minutes.

00:00:30.942 --> 00:00:32.863
Enter the date you completed it.

00:00:33.063 --> 00:00:37.470
Then upload the certificate, or a screenshot of it, and tap Submit.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:46.610
Signing the Levy packet online? Its last section takes the Creating Legends certificate too, so you can do both at once.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:53.440
Up next, part five: alcohol spots. It's optional, only if you want to work them.
